     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\"><b>Update 12/1/2017: </b></span><b style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\">54.204.29.251 has been released. This post will remain pinned until 1/1/2018 as a reminder.</b></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\">In order for applications running on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360597871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lR2C-YDlucK5sPK4fVdlW\">shinyapps.io</a> to access protected resources, we have <a href=\"http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#firewalls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html%23firewalls&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360597871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Xvio89GmnqbWKlzSEG8HB\">documented</a> the IP addresses that are required to be whitelisted.</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\">Previously there was a fourth IP address that we no longer have in active use. We plan to release this IP address on 12/1/2017, at which time it may be used by unrelated services that we do not manage or control.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif\">If you have whitelisted </span>54.204.29.251, please be sure to remove it from your firewall rules prior to 12/1/2017.</b></div></span></div>"
